WEBVTT

00:00:01.241 --> 00:00:02.575
[PHOENIX]
In the peaceful mountain setting

00:00:02.658 --> 00:00:06.575
of the Hazakura Temple,
a brutal murder has taken place.

00:00:06.658 --> 00:00:08.408
Filling in for me
as the defense,

00:00:08.491 --> 00:00:11.283
Miles called the presumed
crime scene into question,

00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:14.450
sending the case back to
the investigative stage.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:15.741
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:17.866
She should've never
taken you under her wing.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.366
You're a coward!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.200
If you had any guts,
she'd be with us right now.

00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:23.741
And it's not just her!

00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:26.450
You're gonna let the same thing
happen to her little sister!

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:28.033
[GODOT grunts]

00:00:28.116 --> 00:00:29.783
[PHOENIX] I believe the murder
took place in the Inner Temple's

00:00:29.866 --> 00:00:31.991
courtyard across Dusky Bridge.

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:34.241
I've found evidence
to back up that theory.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:36.533
But it also raises
troubling questions.

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.241
[PHOENIX]
What the hell is going on?

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:16.325
We just got
the results back from

00:02:16.408 --> 00:02:18.241
the forensics lab,
and they're saying the victim

00:02:18.325 --> 00:02:20.200
wrote this in her own blood.

00:02:20.283 --> 00:02:22.825
So it's a message
from Ms. Deauxnim.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.241
But why was
it written backwards?

00:02:25.325 --> 00:02:26.283
That's the thing that proves

00:02:26.366 --> 00:02:28.033
she wrote it out herself, buddy!

00:02:28.116 --> 00:02:29.033
[PHOENIX]
Uh...

00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:30.491
So there she was,

00:02:30.575 --> 00:02:32.533
being backed into a corner
by this cold-blooded killer.

00:02:32.616 --> 00:02:35.908
She was walking like this, with
her back facing the lantern.

00:02:35.991 --> 00:02:37.283
As you can see,

00:02:37.366 --> 00:02:39.283
if the victim wrote down
her attacker's name

00:02:39.366 --> 00:02:42.075
while standing in this position.

00:02:42.158 --> 00:02:43.991
[PHOENIX]
It would look backwards!

00:02:44.075 --> 00:02:45.825
[GUMSHOE chuckles]

00:02:45.908 --> 00:02:47.325
This spells out "Maya."

00:02:47.408 --> 00:02:49.283
You said she wrote
her attacker's name.

00:02:49.366 --> 00:02:50.950
So you believe
Maya is the killer?

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:54.908
[gasps] Well... I hate
to break it to you, uh...

00:02:54.991 --> 00:02:56.991
That's what HQ's thinkin'.

00:02:57.075 --> 00:02:59.783
[PHOENIX sighs]
There's no way.

00:03:06.908 --> 00:03:11.408
[gasps] I've seen this before.
Elise was wearing it that night.

00:03:14.116 --> 00:03:15.408
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:03:15.491 --> 00:03:17.408
[PHOENIX]
Whoa. It's the same crest!

00:03:17.491 --> 00:03:20.200
The one that's on
the scroll inside.

00:03:20.283 --> 00:03:22.408
Maya told me what it stands for.

00:03:22.491 --> 00:03:24.241
So why did Elise have it?

00:03:27.908 --> 00:03:30.033
Oh, before it slips my mind.

00:03:30.116 --> 00:03:32.908
I found something I thought
was a little weird over there.

00:03:32.991 --> 00:03:34.075
[gasps]

00:03:34.158 --> 00:03:36.450
[GUMSHOE chuckles]
Let's check it out, huh?

00:03:37.783 --> 00:03:41.075
Somebody obviously
tried to burn up this note.

00:03:43.866 --> 00:03:46.366
[PHOENIX gasps]
What is this?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.658
It talks about channeling and
what to do after lights out.

00:03:49.741 --> 00:03:52.575
Are these some
kind of instructions?

00:03:52.658 --> 00:03:53.950
Hey, Detective.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.783
You mind if I hang on
to this for a little while?

00:03:55.866 --> 00:03:58.991
Heh. As long as you keep
it in this bag, we're good.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:03.866
[PHOENIX]
Iris!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.408
[IRIS]
Ah. It's Mister Wright.

00:04:06.491 --> 00:04:08.741
[PHOENIX] Please, you gotta
get Maya outta there quickly!

00:04:08.825 --> 00:04:12.533
Of course. I'm heading over
to the Inner Temple right now.

00:04:12.616 --> 00:04:16.116
Back off! You can wait for
us inside the Main Hall.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:18.241
Are you serious? I'm going, too!

00:04:18.325 --> 00:04:20.616
I assure you, I'm quite serious.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.741
I know what's going on.

00:04:23.825 --> 00:04:25.575
It's because Maya's
a suspect now, right?

00:04:25.658 --> 00:04:27.075
Good to know
that you do understand

00:04:27.158 --> 00:04:28.783
the position you're in.

00:04:28.866 --> 00:04:31.325
Iris! I'm counting on you!

00:04:31.408 --> 00:04:34.408
You're the only one who
can open up that door!

00:04:34.491 --> 00:04:35.491
Right.

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.950
[FRANZISKA]
Let's move!

00:04:41.783 --> 00:04:45.241
[PHOENIX] Okay, guess I gotta
focus on what I can do to help.

00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:49.325
[BIKINI]
Well, this is shocking.

00:04:49.408 --> 00:04:51.741
I didn't think you'd
survived that fall.

00:04:51.825 --> 00:04:53.783
May the gods
have mercy on your soul!

00:04:53.866 --> 00:04:55.575
You do realize I am alive?

00:04:55.658 --> 00:04:57.616
I caught a terrible cold,
but that's about it.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.283
I am absolutely
delighted to hear that!

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:01.741
[sighs]
My word.

00:05:01.825 --> 00:05:04.658
I'm afraid I've made a
horrible mess out of everything.

00:05:04.741 --> 00:05:07.075
First Mystic Elise
dies on my watch,

00:05:07.158 --> 00:05:08.491
now all this with Iris.

00:05:08.575 --> 00:05:10.408
[PHOENIX]
Wait. Did I hear that right?

00:05:10.491 --> 00:05:12.741
Excuse me.
But I couldn't help noticing

00:05:12.825 --> 00:05:14.533
that you referred
to her as "Mystic Elise."

00:05:14.616 --> 00:05:15.908
[BIKINI gasps]

00:05:15.991 --> 00:05:18.075
Why's that? I thought
she was a book illustrator.

00:05:18.158 --> 00:05:20.450
Oh, well, uhh...

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:25.450
It has something
to do with the amulet

00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:27.241
she was wearing doesn't it?

00:05:27.325 --> 00:05:28.616
[gasps]

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.616
[PHOENIX] I remember seeing
this same crest before,

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.575
on the scroll hanging over
in the training hall.

00:05:33.658 --> 00:05:35.700
It's reserved for
the Master of Kurain, right?

00:05:35.783 --> 00:05:39.075
What'd you say?! Hold on,
how do you know about that?!

00:05:39.158 --> 00:05:40.825
Maya explained it to me.

00:05:40.908 --> 00:05:42.658
Did you know that she's
the master's daughter?

00:05:42.741 --> 00:05:45.283
[gasps]
That young trainee?!

00:05:45.366 --> 00:05:47.616
Wait... If she's the
daughter of the master...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.783
[PHOENIX] Hmm.
It means she's the next in line.

00:05:50.866 --> 00:05:54.408
[BIKINI wails]
Oh, Mystic Misty!

00:05:54.491 --> 00:05:57.116
[wails]

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.033
[PHOENIX whimpers]

00:05:59.116 --> 00:06:00.283
So it's true.

00:06:00.366 --> 00:06:01.741
And "Ms. Elise Deauxnim"

00:06:01.825 --> 00:06:03.700
was really just Misty's
Fey's pseudonym.

00:06:03.783 --> 00:06:05.616
Yes. She arrived a week ago.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.575
Of course,
I wasn't expecting her.

00:06:09.575 --> 00:06:10.866
[BIKINI]
Huh?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.325
[BIKINI] And when she
showed me the talisman with

00:06:12.408 --> 00:06:13.908
the master's crest on it.

00:06:13.991 --> 00:06:17.116
I tell you, I nearly
died from the shock.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:20.741
It had been 17 years
since anyone had seen her.

00:06:20.825 --> 00:06:22.158
That's quite an absence.

00:06:22.241 --> 00:06:23.491
Why'd she come back now?

00:06:23.575 --> 00:06:26.116
She was worried
about the state of things.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.366
[MISTY] The Kurain's main
bloodline is in trouble.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.075
We're dangerously
close to dying out.

00:06:31.158 --> 00:06:33.408
I'm going to
stop that from happening.

00:06:33.491 --> 00:06:36.033
That's why I've come here.

00:06:36.116 --> 00:06:37.908
The main bloodline?

00:06:37.991 --> 00:06:41.200
The Kurain School has
but one successor at the moment.

00:06:41.283 --> 00:06:43.033
Only the master and
her daughters are considered

00:06:43.116 --> 00:06:45.366
part of the "main family."

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.116
And the others
are branch families.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.491
That right?

00:06:48.575 --> 00:06:50.741
[BIKINI] Mm-hmm. You can
imagine the Kurain's history

00:06:50.825 --> 00:06:53.075
is littered with... "incidents."

00:06:53.158 --> 00:06:56.033
Times when the branches tried
to take out the main family.

00:06:56.116 --> 00:06:57.950
Assassinations and the like.

00:06:58.033 --> 00:06:59.908
Sounds like a war.

00:06:59.991 --> 00:07:01.241
That's the
same motivation behind

00:07:01.325 --> 00:07:02.700
a case from last year.

00:07:02.783 --> 00:07:04.950
When the master's older sister
tried to frame Maya

00:07:05.033 --> 00:07:06.908
for a murder in the village.

00:07:06.991 --> 00:07:08.991
That's exactly
what I'm talking about.

00:07:09.075 --> 00:07:10.783
But she's been sent away.

00:07:10.866 --> 00:07:13.033
She's in prison,
where she belongs.

00:07:13.116 --> 00:07:15.491
Her main goal in all of that,
was to make little Pearl

00:07:15.575 --> 00:07:18.491
the next master of Kurain.

00:07:18.575 --> 00:07:19.700
That's true.

00:07:19.783 --> 00:07:22.116
If you're already aware
of Mystic Morgan,

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.366
surely you know her
connection to Iris.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.575
Who she really is.

00:07:25.658 --> 00:07:27.575
What? No, who is she?

00:07:27.658 --> 00:07:30.491
Sister Iris is
the estranged daughter

00:07:30.575 --> 00:07:31.700
of Mystic Morgan.

00:07:31.783 --> 00:07:33.533
I had no idea!

00:07:33.616 --> 00:07:35.283
One of a pair
of identical twins,

00:07:35.366 --> 00:07:37.616
and part of another
sad chapter in the family.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.991
Wait. Iris has a twin?

00:07:40.075 --> 00:07:41.658
Seems like Pearl would've
mentioned that she had

00:07:41.741 --> 00:07:43.866
older twin sisters by now.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.575
[BIKINI] Several years ago,
when Mystic Morgan's husband

00:07:46.658 --> 00:07:49.575
at the time learned she would
not become the master,

00:07:49.658 --> 00:07:51.783
he divorced her and
left Kurain Village,

00:07:51.866 --> 00:07:53.866
taking the two girls with him.

00:07:55.033 --> 00:07:57.283
[BIKINI] Later, he realized he
couldn't care for both of them,

00:07:57.366 --> 00:08:00.200
so he brought one
to Hazakura Temple.

00:08:00.283 --> 00:08:01.866
And that's how Iris got here.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.866
How much do you know
about the twins?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.325
Can you at least tell me
Iris's sister's name?

00:08:06.408 --> 00:08:08.283
Was it... Dahlia?

00:08:08.366 --> 00:08:11.533
Yes. I believe
that was her name.

00:08:11.616 --> 00:08:14.533
[gasps]
That's what's been bothering me!

00:08:14.616 --> 00:08:18.366
I can't believe it.
Iris is Dahlia's twin sister!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.158
--[rumbling]
--[BIKINI gasps]

00:08:20.241 --> 00:08:22.616
Ah! What in the world
is happening?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.866
No! An earthquake!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.033
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:08:32.825 --> 00:08:34.408
[BIKINI] May the gods
keep watch over us

00:08:34.491 --> 00:08:35.491
and protect us from harm...

00:08:35.575 --> 00:08:36.950
I think it's over now.

00:08:37.033 --> 00:08:39.908
Ah! Oh, no!
The tremors were strong!

00:08:39.991 --> 00:08:42.325
You have to go and check
on the sacred cavern!

00:08:42.408 --> 00:08:44.075
Yeah, you're right!

00:08:44.158 --> 00:08:45.200
[GUMSHOE whimpers]

00:08:45.283 --> 00:08:46.908
[PHOENIX]
Iris got away?

00:08:46.991 --> 00:08:49.741
[FRANZISKA] Because this scruffy
oaf couldn't control her!

00:08:49.825 --> 00:08:52.533
[yelps]
I'm sorry, ma'am!

00:08:52.616 --> 00:08:54.991
I had just arrived
here with the perpetrator.

00:08:55.075 --> 00:08:56.741
When the ground
began to tremble.

00:08:56.825 --> 00:08:58.908
[GUMSHOE] I went over
to escort the defendant.

00:08:58.991 --> 00:09:01.325
Man, I took my eye
offa her for a second!

00:09:01.408 --> 00:09:03.075
I really stepped in
it this time...

00:09:03.158 --> 00:09:04.491
Fool!

00:09:04.575 --> 00:09:06.783
Well, the more capable officers
have set up checkpoints.

00:09:06.866 --> 00:09:08.783
That'll only be a waste of time.

00:09:08.866 --> 00:09:10.075
What do you mean?

00:09:10.158 --> 00:09:11.991
Answer me, Wright!

00:09:12.075 --> 00:09:13.783
I know where Iris went.

00:09:13.866 --> 00:09:14.783
Right over there.

00:09:14.866 --> 00:09:16.033
The Inner Temple?

00:09:16.116 --> 00:09:18.700
Don't be foolish!
It's completely isolated!

00:09:18.783 --> 00:09:20.033
There's nowhere to run!

00:09:20.116 --> 00:09:22.741
From what I know,
Iris isn't the type to run away.

00:09:26.741 --> 00:09:28.783
--[gasps]
--Wait. What's this?

00:09:28.866 --> 00:09:29.866
[GUMSHOE gasps]

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.741
No, those damned trick locks.

00:09:32.825 --> 00:09:34.408
There are more of them!

00:09:39.116 --> 00:09:40.825
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:09:40.908 --> 00:09:42.325
[ALL gasp]

00:09:42.408 --> 00:09:43.700
[PHOENIX]
Iris.

00:09:43.783 --> 00:09:45.450
I'm sorry for running earlier.

00:09:45.533 --> 00:09:47.491
I wasn't trying to make
things more difficult.

00:09:47.575 --> 00:09:49.241
Just worried
about Sacred Cavern.

00:09:49.325 --> 00:09:51.491
Wonder who put
all those locks on the door.

00:09:51.575 --> 00:09:53.075
[FRANZISKA]
I don't care who.

00:09:53.158 --> 00:09:54.908
Only that they're
removed at once!

00:09:54.991 --> 00:09:57.616
That will prove a
difficult task to accomplish.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.991
What do you mean?

00:09:59.075 --> 00:10:00.533
[IRIS] These are trick locks
that can only be opened

00:10:00.616 --> 00:10:02.241
by the person who set them.

00:10:02.325 --> 00:10:04.325
[gasps]
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:04.408 --> 00:10:07.325
[IRIS] There are hundreds
of possible combinations.

00:10:07.408 --> 00:10:11.450
The only way is to try each
one until it works. But...

00:10:11.533 --> 00:10:13.200
[FRANZISKA]
That's going to take a while.

00:10:13.283 --> 00:10:16.116
[IRIS] Yes. An entire
day, I would imagine.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.158
You think so?

00:10:17.241 --> 00:10:19.283
Well, if that's
the case, so be it.

00:10:19.366 --> 00:10:21.200
You should get started
on them immediately.

00:10:21.283 --> 00:10:24.825
Right. I'll work
as quickly as I can.

00:10:24.908 --> 00:10:25.908
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.491
[PHOENIX]
I'm so worried about Maya.

00:10:33.575 --> 00:10:35.741
She's gonna be trapped
in there another day.

00:10:35.825 --> 00:10:37.491
Please, stay strong.

00:10:37.575 --> 00:10:39.158
[MILES] Are you trying
to catch another cold?

00:10:39.241 --> 00:10:42.158
[gasps]
Hey there, Miles.

00:10:44.991 --> 00:10:46.866
[PHOENIX] I just wish
there was something I can do.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.366
I hate feeling helpless.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.450
[MILES]
Hmm.

00:10:49.533 --> 00:10:51.033
So what brings
you out here, anyway?

00:10:52.283 --> 00:10:54.491
I was curious
about this crystal.

00:10:54.575 --> 00:10:57.408
Wanted to check if
it truly was the victim's.

00:10:57.491 --> 00:10:59.366
You're always
working, aren't you?

00:11:01.908 --> 00:11:03.033
It's so heavy.

00:11:03.116 --> 00:11:04.533
I know.

00:11:04.616 --> 00:11:07.533
I was thinking that I might look
around here again as well.

00:11:07.616 --> 00:11:09.991
Perhaps I could find
the real murder weapon.

00:11:10.075 --> 00:11:11.116
[gasps]

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.950
[gasps]
Oh, wow. Looks like blood.

00:11:22.241 --> 00:11:24.450
Guess your instincts
were right about this one.

00:11:26.241 --> 00:11:27.866
The murder weapon
really was here.

00:11:29.533 --> 00:11:31.033
I'll take it to
forensics right away

00:11:31.116 --> 00:11:33.575
and have them figure out
whose blood this is.

00:11:33.658 --> 00:11:35.075
Thanks.

00:11:35.158 --> 00:11:36.450
[PHOENIX]
Why was Misty Fey carrying

00:11:36.533 --> 00:11:38.200
something like that around?

00:11:40.116 --> 00:11:42.158
[MILES]
I did some research on Iris.

00:11:42.241 --> 00:11:43.700
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:11:43.783 --> 00:11:46.033
[MILES] From the moment
I met her in the jail.

00:11:46.116 --> 00:11:49.283
I couldn't shake the feeling I
had seen her somewhere before.

00:11:49.366 --> 00:11:50.950
But where?

00:11:51.033 --> 00:11:54.866
Now I know.
My first trial as a prosecutor.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.408
A nightmare for
everybody involved.

00:11:57.491 --> 00:12:00.158
You mean Dahlia
Hawthorne. Right?

00:12:00.241 --> 00:12:02.200
[MILES]
Yes. Dahlia.

00:12:03.658 --> 00:12:05.075
A woman I'm certain
you can't erase

00:12:05.158 --> 00:12:06.658
from your thoughts either.

00:12:08.616 --> 00:12:11.825
[PHOENIX sighs]
Yeah, she's hard to forget.

00:12:11.908 --> 00:12:15.616
Yet another thing the two of us
have in common, I suppose.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.200
I didn't know this before,

00:12:17.283 --> 00:12:19.741
but it seems that
she had a twin.

00:12:19.825 --> 00:12:21.700
Which happens to be Sister Iris.

00:12:21.783 --> 00:12:25.241
Yep, that's right.
I'm kinda impressed.

00:12:25.325 --> 00:12:26.741
You've really done
your research.

00:12:26.825 --> 00:12:29.366
This is slightly out
of character for me to say.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:31.158
But I feel like Dahlia
Hawthorne's shadow

00:12:31.241 --> 00:12:32.866
is looming over this case.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.575
'Course it's impossible
she could be involved

00:12:34.658 --> 00:12:35.616
at this point.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.866
Because she's in prison?

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:41.158
Well, Dahlia was in prison,
but now she's no more.

00:12:41.241 --> 00:12:42.450
[gasps]

00:12:42.533 --> 00:12:44.158
[MILES]
It happened about a month ago.

00:12:44.241 --> 00:12:46.450
Her sentence was carried out.

00:12:46.533 --> 00:12:49.658
She was executed.

00:12:49.741 --> 00:12:51.908
[PHOENIX gasps]
Really...?

00:12:51.991 --> 00:12:54.200
This must be quite
a shock for you.

00:12:54.283 --> 00:12:55.700
My apologies.

00:12:55.783 --> 00:12:58.908
But you should know that she
had nothing to do with this.

00:12:58.991 --> 00:13:00.533
Because the simple
fact is that the dead

00:13:00.616 --> 00:13:02.283
can never come back.

00:13:04.991 --> 00:13:08.033
[PHOENIX] Is that a fact?
I don't know what to believe.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.783
[IRIS]
Mister Wright. Is that you?

00:13:16.866 --> 00:13:18.075
[PHOENIX]
Yeah.

00:13:18.158 --> 00:13:19.533
I have some bad news.

00:13:19.616 --> 00:13:20.741
This is harder than I thought,

00:13:20.825 --> 00:13:22.700
so I can't open it
until tomorrow.

00:13:22.783 --> 00:13:25.658
Please don't stop on my account.

00:13:25.741 --> 00:13:29.075
But I'd like ask you
something if you don't mind.

00:13:29.158 --> 00:13:30.450
[IRIS]
What is it?

00:13:30.533 --> 00:13:33.116
It's about the night
of the murder.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.283
After ringing the bell for
lights out at 10 PM,

00:13:36.366 --> 00:13:38.616
you went back to your room,
or at least that's what

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.116
you claim you did.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.741
You think I'm lying about that?

00:13:41.825 --> 00:13:43.033
I saw you there.

00:13:43.116 --> 00:13:44.991
When you were on
your way to ring the bell.

00:13:45.075 --> 00:13:47.366
And I heard it, too,
not long afterward.

00:13:48.908 --> 00:13:51.200
[PHOENIX] But around the same
time, somebody else saw you

00:13:51.283 --> 00:13:52.991
in the Inner Temple.

00:13:53.075 --> 00:13:55.408
They say it happened
at 10 PM as well.

00:13:55.491 --> 00:13:56.825
[IRIS]
Was it Sister Bikini?

00:13:56.908 --> 00:14:00.575
It was. I wasn't in court today,
but I heard about it.

00:14:00.658 --> 00:14:04.491
She said she saw you there.
And even talked to you.

00:14:04.575 --> 00:14:06.033
If she's telling the truth,

00:14:06.116 --> 00:14:10.241
the only explanation is
that there were two of you.

00:14:10.325 --> 00:14:12.158
If that's a joke,
I don't get it.

00:14:12.241 --> 00:14:14.283
How in the world could there
be another one of me?

00:14:14.366 --> 00:14:15.741
Well, what about Dahlia?

00:14:15.825 --> 00:14:18.241
I found out she was
your twin sister.

00:14:18.325 --> 00:14:20.491
And that she was
executed a month ago.

00:14:27.241 --> 00:14:29.075
[IRIS]
What of it?

00:14:29.158 --> 00:14:31.908
I mean, if she's dead, there's
no way she could have been seen.

00:14:31.991 --> 00:14:36.075
[PHOENIX] Mm-mm. Things work
a bit differently around here,

00:14:36.158 --> 00:14:38.533
don't they?

00:14:38.616 --> 00:14:40.908
You know exactly
what I'm talking about.

00:14:40.991 --> 00:14:42.408
The other "you" who
showed up that night

00:14:42.491 --> 00:14:45.408
was your twin sister's spirit.

00:14:45.491 --> 00:14:47.658
So Dahlia was, in fact, here.

00:14:47.741 --> 00:14:50.116
Yes. 'Cause a spirit
medium channeled her.

00:14:55.616 --> 00:14:58.366
[IRIS]
Hmph. You never miss a thing.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.658
It's kind of amazing.

00:14:59.741 --> 00:15:02.325
I see. So you knew after all.

00:15:02.408 --> 00:15:05.200
But I don't understand why
you didn't say anything sooner.

00:15:05.283 --> 00:15:07.200
I've proven myself a traitor.

00:15:07.283 --> 00:15:10.491
So I wasn't about to go and get
in my sister's way this time.

00:15:10.575 --> 00:15:12.033
[PHOENIX]
What do you mean?

00:15:12.116 --> 00:15:15.825
I'm surprised you have to ask.
I mean the fake kidnapping.

00:15:15.908 --> 00:15:18.616
Everything that happened
all those years ago.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.325
After that, our lives
would never be the same again.

00:15:22.408 --> 00:15:24.700
My sister committed
crime after crime,

00:15:24.783 --> 00:15:26.700
and that's why she's dead now.

00:15:26.783 --> 00:15:28.283
But I know none of
this would have happened

00:15:28.366 --> 00:15:29.866
if I hadn't betrayed her.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.241
Betrayed her, how?

00:15:31.325 --> 00:15:33.575
It wasn't a coincidence
that Dusky Bridge was where

00:15:33.658 --> 00:15:35.700
the ransom was going
to be handed over.

00:15:35.783 --> 00:15:37.366
There was a reason behind it.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.158
Because in the original plan,

00:15:39.241 --> 00:15:41.616
I was supposed to be the one
helping her pull it off.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.033
Is that true?

00:15:43.116 --> 00:15:45.533
[IRIS] I got too scared
by the whole thing.

00:15:45.616 --> 00:15:48.033
And ended up
running away instead.

00:15:48.116 --> 00:15:49.325
That's a good thing!

00:15:49.408 --> 00:15:51.366
It means you didn't want
to be an accomplice!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.241
Naturally, you wouldn't
want to steal two million

00:15:53.325 --> 00:15:54.658
from your own father!

00:15:54.741 --> 00:15:56.616
Yeah, but she told me
that he deserved it

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.158
for everything he'd done.

00:15:58.241 --> 00:16:01.116
Especially for abandoning
our poor mother like that,

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.616
because she couldn't be master.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:03.950
I heard about that.

00:16:04.033 --> 00:16:05.658
And about all the
family infighting.

00:16:05.741 --> 00:16:08.533
Yes. Thinking
back on it all now,

00:16:08.616 --> 00:16:10.700
I realize I should've
helped my sister that day.

00:16:10.783 --> 00:16:11.866
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.658
Not to be rude,
but I need to concentrate.

00:16:17.575 --> 00:16:19.575
[PHOENIX]
Can I ask you one last thing?

00:16:19.658 --> 00:16:21.033
[IRIS]
Yes?

00:16:21.116 --> 00:16:22.575
Years ago,

00:16:22.658 --> 00:16:25.658
right after Dahlia poisoned
that defense attorney's coffee,

00:16:25.741 --> 00:16:28.158
she started dating a college
student for several months

00:16:28.241 --> 00:16:29.783
so she could use him.

00:16:29.866 --> 00:16:33.116
I'm curious. Did she ever
talk about that guy?

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:36.450
[IRIS] Not really, but she
did tell me one thing.

00:16:36.533 --> 00:16:41.075
She said...
she hated his guts.

00:16:41.158 --> 00:16:42.616
[PHOENIX]
Thank you.

00:16:46.283 --> 00:16:48.491
Ah, looks good. Yeah.

00:16:50.158 --> 00:16:53.450
Hot! Be careful with it, okay?

00:16:53.533 --> 00:16:55.241
Thanks, I appreciate it.

00:16:56.866 --> 00:16:57.825
[PHOENIX]
That looks good.

00:16:57.908 --> 00:17:00.033
[gasps]
Mister Nick.

00:17:00.116 --> 00:17:03.575
Hey, back off. You can't
just come and steal our taters.

00:17:03.658 --> 00:17:06.366
I wouldn't worry.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:07.783
[BUTZ growls]

00:17:07.866 --> 00:17:11.408
Actually... I was hoping to chat
with Pearl for a minute.

00:17:11.491 --> 00:17:13.950
You want to talk... to me?

00:17:15.908 --> 00:17:17.325
There was a magazine.

00:17:17.408 --> 00:17:20.116
A magazine you had that
mentioned the temple.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.700
That's what got Maya
interested in coming here

00:17:21.783 --> 00:17:23.450
in the first place, right?

00:17:23.533 --> 00:17:25.325
But I wanted to know something.

00:17:25.408 --> 00:17:28.616
Did somebody ask
you to show it to her?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.325
[PEARL gasps] Yeah, but how'd
you figure that out?

00:17:32.408 --> 00:17:34.991
This was found in the
incinerator by the Inner Temple.

00:17:37.575 --> 00:17:38.533
Uh...

00:17:38.616 --> 00:17:39.783
It looks like a plan.

00:17:39.866 --> 00:17:41.950
A way to carry out
this whole thing.

00:17:42.033 --> 00:17:44.075
But somehow it didn't
totally burn up in there.

00:17:44.158 --> 00:17:45.616
[PEARL whimpers]

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.116
Tell the truth.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.158
You were the spirit medium who
channeled Dahlia Hawthorne

00:17:49.241 --> 00:17:50.950
that night, weren't you?

00:17:51.033 --> 00:17:52.116
I'm not mad.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.741
But I'm curious
if you actually know

00:17:53.825 --> 00:17:55.325
who that person is.

00:17:55.408 --> 00:17:56.866
No. I don't.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.950
You be nice to her! You hear?!

00:17:59.033 --> 00:18:01.533
'Cause if not,
I'll tater ya!

00:18:01.616 --> 00:18:03.158
I don't want your stupid tater!

00:18:03.241 --> 00:18:05.950
I swear! I didn't know
anything about a letter!

00:18:06.033 --> 00:18:06.950
No?

00:18:07.033 --> 00:18:08.241
There's no proof!

00:18:08.325 --> 00:18:09.825
You need proof if you're
gonna accuse someone

00:18:09.908 --> 00:18:11.450
of something don't you?

00:18:11.533 --> 00:18:13.075
You really didn't know?

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:16.033
Yeah! Show her
the proof, law man!

00:18:16.116 --> 00:18:18.533
[PHOENIX] All the pieces
just fell into place.

00:18:18.616 --> 00:18:21.616
And now I know exactly how
this whole thing went down.

00:18:23.866 --> 00:18:26.783
How 'bout this?
Somebody read that letter,

00:18:26.866 --> 00:18:29.491
and they channeled Dahlia's
spirit just like it said.

00:18:29.575 --> 00:18:32.241
And whoever did it
was a child. I'm sure.

00:18:32.325 --> 00:18:33.616
Huh?

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.658
I mean, it's pretty obvious
no adult would've made

00:18:35.741 --> 00:18:37.908
a silly little
mistake like that.

00:18:39.075 --> 00:18:41.033
[PHOENIX] There was curry
splattered all over that scroll

00:18:41.116 --> 00:18:42.991
that hangs in the inner temple.

00:18:43.075 --> 00:18:45.241
Come on.
You did that, didn't you?

00:18:45.325 --> 00:18:46.991
[PEARL whimpers]
How'd you know?

00:18:47.075 --> 00:18:48.491
From your reading lesson.

00:18:48.575 --> 00:18:49.658
Remember?

00:18:52.283 --> 00:18:53.283
Uh...

00:18:53.366 --> 00:18:55.533
[PHOENIX]
"Gravely" and "sunder."

00:18:55.616 --> 00:18:57.283
She taught you how to read them.

00:18:57.366 --> 00:18:59.658
But she never explained
what they really meant.

00:18:59.741 --> 00:19:01.450
"Gravely sunder the Master,

00:19:01.533 --> 00:19:03.533
roast her in the
fires of Hades."

00:19:03.616 --> 00:19:05.408
Huh? That sounds crazy.

00:19:05.491 --> 00:19:06.491
There's your proof.

00:19:06.575 --> 00:19:07.700
That work for ya?

00:19:07.783 --> 00:19:09.366
"Gravely" sounded like "gravy."

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.658
So I got pretty confused
about what to do.

00:19:11.741 --> 00:19:13.825
That's why you smeared
curry on that scroll.

00:19:13.908 --> 00:19:17.075
Because that's the closest thing
you had to gravy, right?

00:19:17.158 --> 00:19:18.533
I'm really sorry...

00:19:18.616 --> 00:19:19.950
Now this letter.

00:19:20.033 --> 00:19:22.783
I have a good idea about
who it was that sent it to you.

00:19:22.866 --> 00:19:24.783
It was your mom, wasn't it?

00:19:24.866 --> 00:19:26.866
That's why you
followed the instructions.

00:19:28.991 --> 00:19:31.325
I felt like I didn't
have any other choice.

00:19:31.408 --> 00:19:33.325
That the only way to
honor her final wish,

00:19:33.408 --> 00:19:36.325
was to do everything exactly
like the letter said.

00:19:36.408 --> 00:19:37.825
It was her "final wish"?

00:19:37.908 --> 00:19:39.991
She said that.
She also made it seem like

00:19:40.075 --> 00:19:42.700
the plan would be good
for Mystic Maya, too.

00:19:42.783 --> 00:19:45.283
Did you ever talk
about it in person?

00:19:45.366 --> 00:19:46.991
It was during one
of the times that I went out

00:19:47.075 --> 00:19:48.533
to visit her in jail.

00:19:48.616 --> 00:19:51.075
She told me to look for
the letter at our house.

00:19:51.158 --> 00:19:53.241
[PHOENIX] If she hid it there,
that means all this was planned

00:19:53.325 --> 00:19:56.116
before she had
even been arrested.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:59.866
[PEARL] It's weird. The seal on
the letter had been broken.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.950
Like somebody already
had opened it before I did.

00:20:03.033 --> 00:20:04.991
So you don't think you
were the first one to read it?

00:20:05.075 --> 00:20:06.283
Yeah.

00:20:06.366 --> 00:20:08.325
--[PHOENIX] Hmm...
--[BUTZ] Hmm? It wasn't me!

00:20:08.408 --> 00:20:09.991
[PHOENIX sighs]

00:20:10.075 --> 00:20:11.825
[PHOENIX] Who else could
have known about this?

00:20:11.908 --> 00:20:14.283
And what did they do
with the information?

00:20:14.366 --> 00:20:16.908
I know that I'm being
punished for being bad.

00:20:16.991 --> 00:20:19.450
That's gotta be the reason
why I lost my powers.

00:20:19.533 --> 00:20:21.741
Oh. Like you can't
channel anymore?

00:20:21.825 --> 00:20:23.283
No, I can't.

00:20:23.366 --> 00:20:25.783
After dinner that night, I never
went up to Ms. Elise's room

00:20:25.866 --> 00:20:27.908
to read with her,
like she'd asked.

00:20:27.991 --> 00:20:29.950
I was too worried
about Mystic Maya.

00:20:30.033 --> 00:20:33.033
I see. You went to
the Inner Temple instead.

00:20:33.116 --> 00:20:34.783
The letter said that
I should wait to channel

00:20:34.866 --> 00:20:38.741
the spirit, until after they
rang the bell for lights out.

00:20:38.825 --> 00:20:41.366
[PHOENIX] Then you called
Dahlia Hawthorne's spirit?

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:45.366
[PEARL] I tried, but I
couldn't make it work!

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.658
No spirit came?

00:20:46.741 --> 00:20:49.116
No, never. That's not normal.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.658
I was really surprised.

00:20:50.741 --> 00:20:54.575
But I went ahead and followed
the letter as best I could.

00:20:54.658 --> 00:20:55.991
[PHOENIX] But you got
confused and splattered

00:20:56.075 --> 00:20:57.783
the curry on the scroll.

00:20:57.866 --> 00:20:59.283
[PEARL]
That's right.

00:20:59.366 --> 00:21:02.075
I kept trying over and over
again to summon the spirit.

00:21:02.158 --> 00:21:04.783
But nothing I did ever worked.

00:21:04.866 --> 00:21:06.158
Could there be
any other reason why

00:21:06.241 --> 00:21:07.741
you couldn't channel her?

00:21:07.825 --> 00:21:09.616
I mean besides the
mix-up with the curry?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.783
Well, I can think of one thing.

00:21:11.866 --> 00:21:14.158
There's a small possibility that
another medium had already

00:21:14.241 --> 00:21:15.575
channeled her spirit.

00:21:15.658 --> 00:21:17.658
Everybody only
has one, you know.

00:21:17.741 --> 00:21:19.366
[PHOENIX]
I never thought of that.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:22.366
Did somebody really get
to Dahlia's spirit first?

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:24.491
Mystic Maya's
gonna be okay, right?

00:21:24.575 --> 00:21:27.825
I'm scared. But I know
Mother is watching over her.

00:21:27.908 --> 00:21:30.533
Yeah. I'm sure she is.

00:21:33.533 --> 00:21:37.283
[MORGAN] My dear little Pearl,
you've made your mother proud.

00:21:37.366 --> 00:21:40.158
It's best you don't know
about all the ugliness,

00:21:40.241 --> 00:21:43.325
but now, the main family
is out of the way.

00:21:43.408 --> 00:21:46.700
And at last, you can
assume your rightful place

00:21:46.783 --> 00:21:48.866
as master of the Fey clan.

00:23:20.658 --> 00:23:21.908
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:23:21.991 --> 00:23:23.866
This entire debacle
was the direct result

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:27.366
of a succession fight between
the Kurain school's families.

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:29.450
And of course, I'm involved
in a strange way,

00:23:29.533 --> 00:23:32.200
because of my past
connection to Dahlia.

00:23:32.283 --> 00:23:35.950
This trial will be my chance
to prove that Iris is innocent!

00:23:36.033 --> 00:23:38.450
Her confession just
doesn't sit right with me.

00:23:38.533 --> 00:23:40.533
There's clearly
something missing!

00:23:40.616 --> 00:23:43.116
Find the contradictions!
Believe in the truth!

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:46.408
Next episode: "Bridge
to the Turnabout - 5th Trial"!

00:23:46.491 --> 00:23:47.866
Take that!
